置（日志记录为 `CONFIG_MISSING`）。这导致应用在处理请求（如 `GET /work`）时抛出异常并返回 HTTP 500 状态码，主进程随即以非零退出码（Exit Code 78）主动终止。Kubernetes 根据重启策略不断尝试拉起该 Pod，但因配置问题依旧存在，Pod 陷入持续重启并最终进入 CrashLoopBackOff 状态。\n\n**证据链：**\n1. **现象确认**：K8s 事件显示 Pod 因连续重启进入 BackOff 状态，且容器多次以 Error 状态退出（见证据 #1, #2, #3, #4）。\n2. **资源排除**：Pod 资源请求与限制配置合理，排除了内存不足（OOMKilled）导致被 K8s 杀死的常见情况（见证据 #5）。\n3. **机制定位**：应用日志中反复出现 `CONFIG_MISSING` 错误及 HTTP 500 状态（见证据 #6）。\n4. **链路闭环**：深度追踪数据不仅捕获了 HTTP 500 请求，还明确标注了故障模式为 `config_missing_exit`，且其 Trace ID 与日志记录中的 Trace ID 完全匹配，确认了上述因果逻辑（见证据 #7）。\n\n**未确认事项：**\n目前证据未能揭示具体缺失的配置文件名、变量名，也无法追溯至上游配置管理系统的故障根因。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.5m\n├─ 问题定位: 16.9s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 60.3s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn: 60.3s (Evidence 52.3s, RCA 7.8s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 14.3s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 91.53, "metrics": {"run_id": "59c573d7fd7f4f2f", "mttr": {"value": "1.5m", "seconds": 91.53708744049072, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 91537.08744049072, "llm_calls": 11, "llm_duration_ms": 84379.88686561584, "tool_calls": 12, "executed_tool_calls": 12, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 12, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 15413.493633270264, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 6786.838531494141}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 16884.088039398193, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 60280.030488967896, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 14346.937656402588, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

